-- title:
--   Coefficientwise identification of the level field over K₀
-- statement:
--   Let $q$ be a prime with $q\ge 5$, let $M'$ be a nonzero natural number with $q\nmid M'$, and write $H=$ `levelH q M'` for the kernel of the reduction map $(\mathbb{Z}/q^2M')^\times\to(\mathbb{Z}/q)^\times$. Let $K_0$ be a subfield of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ containing an element $\zeta$ that is a primitive $q$-th root of unity. Let $\bar F=$ `fieldBar q M'` be the intermediate field of $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}((X))$ over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ generated by the coefficientwise image of the rational $q$-expansion function field `xHFunctionField (q ^ 2 * M') (levelH q M')` $\subseteq\mathbb{Q}((X))$ under the map induced by $\mathbb{Q}\hookrightarrow\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$, and let $F_0$ be a subfield of $\bar F$ characterised by the hypothesis that an element $f\in\bar F$ lies in $F_0$ if and only if every Laurent coefficient $\mathrm{coeff}_n(f)$, $n\in\mathbb{Z}$, lies in $K_0$. The assertion is that there is a ring isomorphism $e$ from `laurentBaseChange ↥K₀ (xHFunctionField (q ^ 2 * M') (levelH q M'))`, the intermediate field of $K_0((X))$ over $K_0$ generated by the coefficientwise image of that rational function field, onto $F_0$, such that for every $f$ in the source the Laurent series over $\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ underlying $e(f)$ is obtained from $f$ by applying the inclusion $K_0\hookrightarrow\overline{\mathbb{Q}}$ to each coefficient.
--
--   This is the descent of the function field of the full-level modular curve to the subfield of constants $K_0$: the field of modular functions all of whose $q$-expansion coefficients lie in $K_0$ is, coefficientwise, the compositum of $K_0$ with the rational $q$-expansion function field inside $K_0((X))$. It is used to transfer statements about the level field over the constants $K_0$ to the field $F_0$ given only by its coefficient characterisation, and it is cited in the construction of the fixed field at auxiliary level.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/anthropics/fermats-last-theorem/blob/aa2d8b34692b16c70f699536de0d8e75b9a3e9ef/Theorems/Thm_ModularCurve_FullLevel_exists_ringEquiv_laurentBaseChange_coe_eq_coeffMap_of_forall_mem_iff_forall_coeff_mem.lean

